                <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2">SEARCH, Gadchiroli</h2>
                <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4 flex-grow">The Society for Education, Action and Research in Community Health (SEARCH) is a pioneering organization based in the tribal district of Gadchiroli, Maharashtra. It is globally recognized for its groundbreaking research and community-based health interventions, most notably the home-based newborn care model that dramatically reduced infant mortality rates. SEARCH combines rigorous research with direct action, addressing major health issues like pneumonia, reproductive health, and non-communicable diseases through a people-centric approach.</p>
                <a href="https://search.org.in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-block bg-blue-600 text-white font-semibold py-2 px-5 rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-700 transition text-center">
                    Visit Website
                </a>
                 <div class="mt-3 text-center text-xs text-gray-500">
                    <p>info@search.org.in | +91-987-654-3214</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 6: Antara Foundation -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg overflow-hidden transform hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-300 border flex flex-col">
            <img class="w-full h-52 object-cover" src="https://antarafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/antara_blog_dummy_image.jpg" alt="A frontline health worker with a group of mothers">
            <div class="p-6 flex flex-col flex-grow">
                <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2">Antara Foundation</h2>
                <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4 flex-grow">Antara Foundation works on improving maternal and child health outcomes by strengthening the public health delivery system from the ground up. Their core strategy involves intensive training and mentorship of frontline health workers, such as ASHAs and Anganwadi workers, to enhance their skills and motivation. By focusing on simple, evidence-based interventions and improving the quality of service delivery, they have made a significant impact on reducing maternal and infant mortality in rural parts of Rajasthan and Madhya Pradesh.</p>
                <a href="https://www.antara-foundation.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-block bg-blue-600 text-white font-semibold py-2 px-5 rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-700 transition text-center">
                    Visit Website
                </a>
                 <div class="mt-3 text-center text-xs text-gray-500">
                    <p>info@antara.org | +91-987-654-3215</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 7: Armman -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg overflow-hidden transform hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-300 border flex flex-col">
            <img class="w-full h-52 object-cover" src="https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcTPrYjGnfKkJV_pis5nrb4t68XLiwT3QnpeN5ANrPqBukh87eN3LIlScbTbZG3BGPwCWj0&usqp=CAU" alt="A pregnant woman using a mobile phone">
            <div class="p-6 flex flex-col flex-grow">
                <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2">Armman</h2>
                <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4 flex-grow">Armman is a leading non-profit that leverages technology to create scalable solutions for improving the health of pregnant women, new mothers, and children. Their flagship programs, like mMitra, send free, timed, and targeted preventive care information through voice calls directly to the mobile phones of women in low-income communities. This simple yet powerful intervention ensures that women receive critical health information throughout pregnancy and infancy, empowering them to make healthier choices for themselves and their children.</p>
                <a href="https://armman.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-block bg-blue-600 text-white font-semibold py-2 px-5 rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-700 transition text-center">
                    Visit Website
                </a>
                 <div class="mt-3 text-center text-xs text-gray-500">
                    <p>info@armman.org | +91-987-654-3216</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 8: Seva Mandir -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg overflow-hidden transform hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-300 border flex flex-col">
            <img class="w-full h-52 object-cover" src="https://www.sevamandir.org/images/logo-white.png" alt="A group of women in a rural village meeting">
            <div class="p-6 flex flex-col flex-grow">
                <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2">Seva Mandir</h2>
                <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4 flex-grow">For over 50 years, Seva Mandir has been working on integrated rural development in the tribal regions of southern Rajasthan. Their holistic approach addresses interconnected issues of health, education, livelihoods, and governance. The health program focuses on strengthening maternal and child health services, improving immunization coverage, and tackling malnutrition through community engagement and by training local health volunteers. They empower communities to take charge of their own development and health outcomes.</p>
                <a href="https://www.sevamandir.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-block bg-blue-600 text-white font-semibold py-2 px-5 rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-700 transition text-center">
                    Visit Website
                </a>
                 <div class="mt-3 text-center text-xs text-gray-500">
                    <p>info@sevamandir.org | +91-987-654-3217</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        
         <!-- Card 9: Piramal Swasthya -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg overflow-hidden transform hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-300 border flex flex-col">
            <img class="w-full h-52 object-cover" src="https://d2q79iu7y748jz.cloudfront.net/s/_squarelogo/256x256/f2d038f2fc514e2a23754bd866b2cd1b" alt="A doctor using a laptop for a telemedicine consultation">
            <div class="p-6 flex flex-col flex-grow">
                <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2">Piramal Swasthya</h2>
                <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4 flex-grow">Piramal Swasthya is one of India's largest non-profit organizations focused on public primary healthcare. They operate a wide range of services, including telemedicine health advice helplines, mobile medical units, and community outreach programs that bring healthcare directly to the doorsteps of underserved rural populations. By integrating technology and working in partnership with state governments, they aim to make healthcare accessible, affordable, and equitable for millions of people across India.</p>
